===Etymology===
;"segment, section, piece"
:Exopassive of {{och-l|辨|id=2|to divide, distinguish, discriminate}}; possibly in the same word-family as another exopassive {{och-l|釆|[to cause to be] divided}}. These three thus may be related to either {{och-l|班|to distribute → to arrange, classify → class, group}} or {{cog|lus|pʰel||to split, cut in halves}} (with medial *{{IPAfont|-r-}} dropped after labial initials according to Mizo phonotactics) ({{zh-ref|Schuessler, 2007}}).

;"petal"
:Either same etymon as "segment, section, piece"; or same etymon as {{och-l|葩|flower}}; or related to {{och-l|燔|to burn}}, if so, semantically parallel to {{cog|bo|མེ་ཏོག||flower}}, literally "fire-top".

